  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to The Reckoning Project 2023-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till The Reckoning Project 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att bidra till ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande i Ukraina i relation till Rysslands fullskaliga invasion 2022. Fokus ligger p&#xe5; att st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna att utreda r&#xe4;ttsfall som r&#xf6;r rysk deportation, tv&#xe5;ngsf&#xf6;rflyttning, omskolning och indoktrinering av ukrainska barn, fr&#xe4;mst genom kapacitetsbyggande insatser f&#xf6;r ukrainska oberoende mediejournalister och forskare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to accountability in Ukraine in relation to Russia&apos;s full-scale invasion 2022. The focus is on strengthening the preconditions for investigation and persecution related to the deportation, forced transfer, re-education and indoctrination of Ukrainian children, mainly through capacity building efforts for Ukrainian independent media journalists and researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
